  "term": "catecholaminergic",
  "definition": "Catecholaminergic means involving catecholamines, a group of chemical messengers in the nervous system. In this context, it refers to inputs to hippocampal area CA1 that use these chemicals and can influence activity important for object-location learning and memory.",
